From bf0a936b53ce6de0bc4a7716101b2f80fcf49ffc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 19/23] ASoC: mediatek: add the MT6878 AFE

The MT6878 audio front end: memory interfaces, the ADDA link to the
MT6369 codec (MTKAIF 2.0, clock protocol 2) and the ETDM I2S ports.
Register map and the ADDA/I2S sequences follow the MediaTek vendor
driver; memif handling uses the common MediaTek AFE helpers.

32-bit (S32_LE) memif data comes out wrong on this AFE, while S16_LE
and S24_LE are correct, so the front ends only offer those two.
